usage: check-adjacency-anchors.py [-h] (--revision REV | --selftest)
                                  [--ownership-corrections] [--branch BRANCH]
                                  [--registry REGISTRY] [--registry-from REV]
                                  [--siblings-root SIBLINGS_ROOT]

Read-only verifier for round-19 portable adjacency anchors.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --revision REV        7-64 hex commit landed and pushed on the selected
                        branch
  --selftest            run hermetic git-fixture cases
  --ownership-corrections
                        count the exact R20 OUT-009 scope correction
  --branch BRANCH       landed branch for revision binding (default master)
  --registry REGISTRY   lane-relative registry JSON path
  --registry-from REV   read registry, census and snapshots from this bound
                        revision
  --siblings-root SIBLINGS_ROOT
                        root containing read-only sibling repositories
                        (<name>-shokunin)
